    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "VOYAGER demonstrates strong in-context lifelong learning capabilities, outperforming prior state-of-the-art methods in terms of exploration performance, tech tree mastery, and zero-shot generalization. It's able to construct an ever-growing skill library of action programs that are reusable, interpretable, and generalizable to novel tasks.",
