    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "VOYAGER has significant implications for the development of embodied agents that can learn and adapt in open-ended environments. Its ability to acquire diverse skills and make new discoveries without human intervention makes it a promising approach for applications such as robotics and game playing. The use of large language models and iterative prompting mechanisms also opens up new possibilities for **multimodal perception** and **human-AI collaboration**.",
